      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788085370674,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Tokens : \n    Nothing but words of shorter length\n\nTokenizer : \n    converting words into tokens, and tokens into numbers \n    each token will have explicit predefined number\nThe number will be provided to transformer - which will perform operation on numbers\nand provide the result \n ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Tokens : \n    Nothing but words of shorter length\n\nTokenizer : \n    converting words into tokens, and tokens into numbers \n    each token will have explicit predefined number\nThe number will be provided to transformer - which will perform operation on numbers\nand provide the result \n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "x2RHq0KKowy3sXLwckcGK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 538,
      "y": 725.5,
      "width": 858.1394653320312,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1856600845,
      "version": 192,
      "versionNonce": 2000522115,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788086976979,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "RAG : \n    External documents which we are going to provide to llm will be split into chunks and\nstored as random floating numbers in vector db by embedding model ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "RAG : \n    External documents which we are going to provide to llm will be split into chunks and\nstored as random floating numbers in vector db by embedding model ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "gQseu0Hz92LCkFdkOjbvd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 543,
      "y": 828.5,
      "width": 1017.3392333984375,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1940117987,
      "version": 1011,
      "versionNonce": 782082851,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788088650405,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "So if we provide a data - \"webserver is used to host a webapplication - that accepts http req \nand gives http responses\" vectordb will store it as numbers by embedding model which used tokenization\n\nLets say,\non tokenization : \"web\", \"server\", \"is\", \"used\", \"to\", \"host\", \"a\", \"web\",\"app\",\"lication\" ....\n                                -2 , -3.4, 2.4,3.4, 26.4, 243.3 , 2 , 323, 64.3 , 23,6\nand these numbers may store in vectordb\n\non searching or prompting the llm - \"What is webserver\" \n    again it will convert it into tokens \" like : 23.12, 2.4 , -2, -3.4\n\nupto some specific total length of chunks\nthen each chunk of number will be searched in vectordb, find its matching result and provide the result \nby forming a meaningful data from existing in vectordb",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "So if we provide a data - \"webserver is used to host a webapplication - that accepts http req \nand gives http responses\" vectordb will store it as numbers by embedding model which used tokenization\n\nLets say,\non tokenization : \"web\", \"server\", \"is\", \"used\", \"to\", \"host\", \"a\", \"web\",\"app\",\"lication\" ....\n                                -2 , -3.4, 2.4,3.4, 26.4, 243.3 , 2 , 323, 64.3 , 23,6\nand these numbers may store in vectordb\n\non searching or prompting the llm - \"What is webserver\" \n    again it will convert it into tokens \" like : 23.12, 2.4 , -2, -3.4\n\nupto some specific total length of chunks\nthen each chunk of number will be searched in vectordb, find its matching result and provide the result \nby forming a meaningful data from existing in vectordb",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LeOH5jTalwLVSx8QZESep",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 565,
      "y": 1228.5,
      "width": 422.0397644042969,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
