      "versionNonce": 96980099,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788100723471,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ai model numbers/dimensions for each chunk : \n    small = 384 dimension\n    medium - 768 dimension \n    large = 1536 dimension - upto 30k dimension \n\nfor large dimension : rich info + large storage + slow\nfor slow dimension: fast + less storage + limited info ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ai model numbers/dimensions for each chunk : \n    small = 384 dimension\n    medium - 768 dimension \n    large = 1536 dimension - upto 30k dimension \n\nfor large dimension : rich info + large storage + slow\nfor slow dimension: fast + less storage + limited info ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Olq0St2PfcVF0Zs4IbPik",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 502,
      "y": 2116.5,
      "width": 657.03955078125,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
