      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788099142711,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "RAG - Retrieval Augmented Generation: ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "RAG - Retrieval Augmented Generation: ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "_vjczN4WNCuhtXxsSdlbz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 482.6999969482422,
      "y": 2486.699993133545,
      "width": 823.7593383789062,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aN",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 235779459,
      "version": 181,
      "versionNonce": 1204373795,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788100703161,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Practical Project ; \n    Both questions and datas will be converted into vectors by splitting into chunks\n    only actual data are stored in vector db ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Practical Project ; \n    Both questions and datas will be converted into vectors by splitting into chunks\n    only actual data are stored in vector db ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "c6bfIu7yAb4FI4zoA6md7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 530.4499931335449,
      "y": 2625.6999893188477,
      "width": 747.6995239257812,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aO",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 181028685,
      "version": 320,
      "versionNonce": 1846767875,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788100700645,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "We will split data - into chunks. \neg : if there is a page with 10 paras - then we will split each para as 1 chunk\nto avoid data loss, we put 2nd para's 1st line in both chunk1 and chunk2, \n    similarly we overlap some data across chunks - to avoid data loss",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "We will split data - into chunks. \neg : if there is a page with 10 paras - then we will split each para as 1 chunk\nto avoid data loss, we put 2nd para's 1st line in both chunk1 and chunk2, \n    similarly we overlap some data across chunks - to avoid data loss",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "KjThBdtpNpD570Bj878r7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 541.1999816894531,
      "y": 2746.6999740600586,
      "width": 665.3395385742188,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aQ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 113730061,
      "version": 260,
      "versionNonce": 1603898979,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788100698095,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "chunk splitting : 500 chars per chunk, where 100 chunks overlapping \nchunk1 - 0 to 499\nchunk2 - 400 to 899\nchunk3 - 800 to 1299\nchunk4 - 1200 to 1699\n\nk=3 -> For my given data fetch top 3 relevant data/info ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "chunk splitting : 500 chars per chunk, where 100 chunks overlapping \nchunk1 - 0 to 499\nchunk2 - 400 to 899\nchunk3 - 800 to 1299\nchunk4 - 1200 to 1699\n\nk=3 -> For my given data fetch top 3 relevant data/info ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "6JwV604v_SLdRUumiO3nO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 539.1999931335449,
      "y": 2954.1999740600586,
      "width": 776.7994384765625,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aR",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1111900259,
      "version": 767,
      "versionNonce": 1627067213,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788101221718,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "why do we use 500 char -> Goldilocks (not too big not too small) principle\n     in english : 5 to 6 chars - one small word \n            11 to 12 chars - avg word \n    500 chars / 5 chunks = 100 words per chunk \n    500 / 6 = 83 words per chunk \n\nRAG : \n    any openai , claude , any ai gives two models : embedding model & gpt \n    gpt - transformer, embedding model - for serializing and deserializing vectors\nEach chunk will be transformed into vectors :\n    c1 - [0.44, 0.22, 0.31 ,... ]\n    similarly the input question also converted into chunks \n\n\n    For openai model, around 1536 dimensions(number) will be created",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "why do we use 500 char -> Goldilocks (not too big not too small) principle\n     in english : 5 to 6 chars - one small word \n            11 to 12 chars - avg word \n    500 chars / 5 chunks = 100 words per chunk \n    500 / 6 = 83 words per chunk \n\nRAG : \n    any openai , claude , any ai gives two models : embedding model & gpt \n    gpt - transformer, embedding model - for serializing and deserializing vectors\nEach chunk will be transformed into vectors :\n    c1 - [0.44, 0.22, 0.31 ,... ]\n    similarly the input question also converted into chunks \n\n\n    For openai model, around 1536 dimensions(number) will be created",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
